  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present on">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Being mindful <em>is the work.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Triplicity is coaching with a real coach: a key a day, your log read every week, a circle of six, for a year.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply for the Coached Year</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome">Welcome to Triplicity — <b>Love</b></p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>1</b><span>Session a week</span></div><div><b>6</b><span>In your circle</span></div><div><b>12</b><span>Months</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Coach who reads your log</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>You know what to do.<br>Nobody is in the room when you don't.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Alone</h3><p>Good intentions with no one on the other end.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unread</h3><p>You write it down. Nobody reads it.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unheld</h3><p>The weekend high. The Tuesday fade.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years leading teams and families through hard seasons. He walks the keys on the same calendar you do.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Apply</h3><p>A thirty-minute call with Russ inside 48 hours.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Fourteen days</h3><p>The log, three lines a night. He reads it.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The year</h3><p>A session a week. A circle of six. The gates confirmed.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The Years</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Core</div><h3>The Coached Year</h3><div class="price">Apply</div><p>A session a week, a circle of six, a key a day. Twelve months.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Household</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">Apply</div><p>For two to four people. One coach. One rhythm.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Leader + team</div><h3>Executive &amp; Team</h3><div class="price">Apply</div><p>One leader, a team circle of eight, the gates as a shared language.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Not ready for a coach? <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Start with the Keys at Vault Human — $97/mo.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Triplicity is the present.</h2><p class="lede">Learn from the past. Love the present. Live for the future.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Reads the systems you inherited and rebuilds them.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green me" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com"><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. A coach reads your log for a year.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>Estate and life-law planning. The documents a life is lived on.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Triplicity do?</summary><p>Coaching, for a year, with a coach who reads what you write.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. Where a key is someone else's door, we point to it.</p></details><details><summary>Who coaches?</summary><p>Russ. Eighteen clients in 2027, in three circles of six.</p></details><details><summary>How much time?</summary><p>A key a day, fifty minutes a week with your coach, an hour with your circle.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Apply for the Coached Year.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes with Russ. Then you decide.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply for the Coached Year</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
